== (2) the S1 (= S3) equant and vicarious texts: which geometric model do they describe?
   S1 text eqv_S1(X, Y) puts the equant at distance X + Y and the centre at distance X from the Sun.
   S1 equant text with element e  ==  vicarious form with centre 2e, equant 3e:  max diff 2.544e-14 deg
   S1 vicarious text with (e1,e2) ==  vicarious form with centre e1+e2, equant e1+2e2: max diff 7.633e-14 deg
   at e = 0.0934 (Mars), the S1 equant text and the bisected equant differ by up to 327.3 arcmin for the same elements
